<title>USA: Patapsco Bancorp Inc Q1 Sept 30 full results.</title>
<headline>Patapsco Bancorp Inc Q1 Sept 30 full results.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>At			    At</p>
